  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Union Adaltchi Seed Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Union des Coopratives Adaltchi de Konni seeks to significantly strengthen its management capacity and expand their seed production activities to generate higher revenues. This project will support the construction of a warehouse for storage, equipment to enhance production capabilities, high quality inputs, and coaching in production techniques, marketing, and financial management.</narrative>
